From 1d170e437a2c429973f62149a05dcef8bf17eca4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:47:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] Vizzbox 1.1: 22 new subgenres and the genre AFRO &
 LATIN, CC 110 (BRIEF-VIZZBOX-1.1.md 4, 5)

Every subgenre of the brief's list, each a row of VB_SUB from the generators there are (tempo, swing, form, raster,
bass, chord, lead and arp styles and their sound lists): HOUSE PROG HOUSE, BASS HOUSE; TECHNO ACID TECHNO, INDUSTRIAL;
ELECTRO NU-DISCO, DARKSYNTH; TRANCE HARD TRANCE; BREAKS BASSLINE, GRIME, JERSEY CLUB; DRUM & BASS HALFTIME; DUBSTEP
RIDDIM, FUTURE BASS; HIP-HOP DRILL, PHONK; AMBIENT TRIP-HOP; HARD HARDCORE, FRENCHCORE; and after HARD the genre
AFRO & LATIN: AMAPIANO, AFROBEATS, REGGAETON, BAILE FUNK. Six drum rasters where the style needs its own (amapiano,
afrobeats, dembow, drill, jersey club, tamborzao) and hat rolls as trap's (VF_ROLL: drill, phonk, future bass). Two
sound lists measured as 1.0's (tools/vizzbox_pick.py now keeps every sound and list there is and appends): a log drum
for amapiano, bells for phonk and drill. The 36 of 1.0 keep their genre and subgenre numbers (CC 108 / 109, the
favourites) and their place in VB_SUB (their random streams, their trims): the new come after them (vb_rig, vb_gof),
their levels by tools/vizzbox_level.py (the new only). ENDLESS: from a new subgenre to every tempo neighbour, from one
of 1.0's among 1.0's only (their songs). CC 110 on channel 16: the FX layer's effect held (the user's first, else the
producer's), 1..14 in the keys' order, 0 none; when it changes and on each bar's one after the six. The knobs' big
value in M when the big face lacks a character ("AFRO & LATIN", 1.0's "DRUM & BASS"), as Skiff's cards set it.

tests/producer_test.c: every new subgenre in every LENGTH as 1.0's, ENDLESS 30 min from AMAPIANO (its neighbours new
and old; a drop's kick counted from its CC 104's render chunk: after a tempo glide the tracks can step into the bar a
block before Skiff's launch clock, as in 1.0), cc110; tests/vizzbox_golden.c leaves CC 110 out (1.0 never sends it);
tests/vizzbox_budget.c over all 58; tests/vizzbox_fuzz.c (1.1) the pages, the focus, the layers held, MOMENTARY,
PRESETS, given back, the GROOVEBOX between, the genres to AFRO & LATIN; tests/vizzbox_mutants.py: a new subgenre
moving an old number. tools/vizzbox_demos.py: the firmware's counts, "new" for the new ones, the README's rows of
those not rendered kept; tools/vizzbox_render.c names a style by vb_rig.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R1rawochSWXFaES57pjc4r
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
